      </div>
      <p>All plans include unmetered bandwidth on 1 Gbit/s shared ports, DDoS protection (game-server grade, 480+ Gbps mitigation capacity), and full root access. Linux distributions include Debian, Ubuntu, CentOS, Rocky, AlmaLinux, Fedora, and Arch. Windows Server licenses can be added for an extra fee.</p>
      <p>The €2.99/mo entry point positions ZAP-Hosting as a mid-tier European alternative to RackNerd's $1.99/mo US-focused plans. For European users prioritizing low latency to Frankfurt or Paris, this is a meaningful upgrade path at modest cost.</p>

      <h2>Datacenter Footprint</h2>
      <p>ZAP-Hosting operates 10+ global datacenter locations spanning Europe, North America, and Asia-Pacific:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Europe:</strong> Frankfurt, Strasbourg, London, Madrid, Helsinki, Warsaw</li>
        <li><strong>North America:</strong> Ashburn (US East), Dallas (US Central), Los Angeles (US West)</li>
        <li><strong>Asia-Pacific:</strong> Singapore, Tokyo</li>
        <li><strong>South America:</strong> São Paulo</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This geographic spread is competitive for a European-headquartered provider. The Frankfurt and Strasbourg nodes are particularly strong for EU users, and the inclusion of Tokyo and Singapore gives reasonable Asia-Pacific coverage for global indie projects. The network runs on Tier-1 transit with 10 Gbit/s+ uplinks and direct peering to major European IXPs (DE-CIX, LINX, AMS-IX).</p>

      <h2>Key Features</h2>
      <p>ZAP-Hosting's VPS plans include a comprehensive set of features that reflect their 25+ years of experience in the hosting market:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>KVM Virtualization with Full Root Access</strong> — dedicated resources, no overselling, full administrative control</li>
        <li><strong>Game-Server-Grade DDoS Protection</strong> — 480+ Gbps mitigation capacity, included free on all plans (a significant cost saving vs providers charging $10-30/mo for similar protection)</li>
        <li><strong>One-Click Game Server Installers</strong> — 50+ titles including Minecraft, CS2, Rust, Valheim, ARK, Satisfactory, Palworld, Project Zomboid, Terraria, and 7 Days to Die</li>
        <li><strong>Custom ZAP Web Interface</strong> — in-house developed control panel for VM management, restart, console access, and ISO mounting</li>
        <li><strong>Hourly Billing</strong> — pay per-hour for active VMs, useful for short-lived dev/staging environments</li>
        <li><strong>Unmetered Bandwidth</strong> — no traffic caps on all plans, suitable for streaming and bandwidth-intensive workloads</li>
        <li><strong>Free Backups (7-day rolling)</strong> — automatic snapshots, included on all plans</li>
        <li><strong>API Access</strong> — REST API for programmatic VM management and integration with CI/CD pipelines</li>
        <li><strong>24/7 Support via Ticket and Live Chat</strong> — German-headquartered team with English coverage</li>
      </ul>

