      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <h3>Is ZAP-Hosting reliable?</h3>
      <p>ZAP-Hosting has been in operation since 1998 — over 25 years. They maintain 99.9% uptime SLAs and operate 10+ global datacenters with Tier-1 transit. The company is independently owned and headquartered in Germany.</p>
      <h3>Does ZAP-Hosting offer a money-back guarantee?</h3>
      <p>ZAP-Hosting offers a 14-day money-back guarantee on most products. For game server hosting, they also offer trial periods on selected titles. Refund processing is straightforward via the customer panel.</p>
      <h3>Can I install custom software on ZAP-Hosting VPS?</h3>
      <p>Yes — full root SSH access is included on all VPS plans, and you can install any Linux-compatible software. ZAP-Hosting also provides a library of pre-built application templates for common workloads (Docker, Nextcloud, Plesk, cPanel, etc.).</p>
      <h3>What happens if I need to cancel?</h3>
      <p>ZAP-Hosting uses a 30-day notice period for cancellation on monthly plans. Annual plans can be cancelled for pro-rated refunds within the 14-day window. Account deletion is processed within 7 days of cancellation request.</p>
